(scripts/pack-engine-artifact.sh) downloads them from a release of the
maintained fork elseform/dxmt (https://github.com/elseform/dxmt): release
builds, stripped, macOS 15 deployment target. The release tag and commit are
recorded in each archive's engine-manifest.json ("dxmt"). This notice is
shipped in the archive as lib/dxmt/NOTICE.
